{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "d78d9346f5c0653a25db8dcdc4060906c0f789e8843cf0b4feae498b82c21828", "ja": "グラビア撮影　開始前", "zh": "写真摄影　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6000_place", "source_sha256": "497252db63b728994e9f7500df91ae1170cc4d18cf8a65b4ff453c3934afa4d3", "ja": "撮影場所", "zh": "拍摄地点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6001_p", "source_sha256": "b8b012275af169d841c6a266686c90da26d7e72d3a0e189e738c6e7d2147d059", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n可憐が子猫と遊んでいるところを撮影する予定だ）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n计划拍摄可怜和小猫一起玩耍的场景）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6002_045kar", "source_sha256": "ea17193b7a40ccf957b0be1f420cbcb52b0082393fb77e9dd063c6f4491c3e01", "ja": "あ、あの……。{$P$}さん……。\n少し、いいでしょうか……？", "zh": "啊，那个……{$P$}先生……\n可以占用您一点时间吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6003_p", "source_sha256": "b4172bd3d3718a4aa424a6835dc71c73a5424bbd6eb1d22e6050f76cd69adbee", "ja": "どうした、可憐？\nなにか気になることでもあったか？", "zh": "怎么了，可怜？\n是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6004_045kar", "source_sha256": "6688b75c8c9376651d0a3f362f4ff11e76d10344f0622b5b21c9c5663568d1b5", "ja": "えっと……き、今日の撮影なんですが……。\n実は、ちょっと不安なことがあって……。", "zh": "那个……关、关于今天的拍摄……其实，我有件事有点不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6005_045kar", "source_sha256": "89ef8986bdc5106c4af55d9e2c5483d558ca4b2f7ca69fdc276a45b350a0e451", "ja": "わ、私が、あんまり子猫に慣れてなくて……。\nその……力加減を間違えちゃわないか心配で……。", "zh": "我、我不太习惯和小猫相处……\n那个……很担心自己会控制不好手上的力道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6006_p", "source_sha256": "e225e8bc0505434c503a25a6fe4154159bae1c9c6af6bcd4a93df18d62a4148a", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに、それは不安だな。\nでも優しく触ってあげれば、大丈夫だと思うけど……。", "zh": "原来如此……确实会让人不安。\n不过，只要温柔地摸它，我觉得应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6007_045kar", "source_sha256": "111e70b9336dc3f93b5e865525f472a2ba282b8cdab80cad439954daac6659a2", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……。優しく、丁寧に……って。\n頭では、わかってるんです……。でも……。", "zh": "对、对呢……温柔地、仔细地……我脑子里明白这些……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6008_045kar", "source_sha256": "c618e13a61a5088e2b2da86e56bc6b11b52b652abe5a93c39e088f4dc755f60c", "ja": "緊張が子猫に伝わって……き、嫌われちゃったり、\nふ、不安にさせちゃったりしないかなって。うぅ……。", "zh": "要是我的紧张传给小猫……它、它会不会讨厌我，或者让它感到不安呢。我好担心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6009_p", "source_sha256": "ab39a24697bf553ec4d3579e2eda918ac6c4a8408ce100bd237406db39e338ff", "ja": "（うーん……思ったより緊張してるみたいだな……。\n可憐の緊張が、少しでも解れる方法を……。よし！）", "zh": "（嗯……好像比想象中还要紧张啊……要想办法让可怜放松一点……好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6010", "source_sha256": "822916f01b3b4d2ec1535692dcbb4104653f771c683fbfddb8df7c069e1e351d", "ja": "お母さん猫の匂いだ！", "zh": "是猫妈妈的气味！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6011", "source_sha256": "a95b2697ed31c0e64ff1699415ae80c5e8719df35f52fd9e12b1e528f428204e", "ja": "子猫になろう！", "zh": "变成小猫吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6012", "source_sha256": "ed81bc734127d87611797bdf965d7bd05c5c1bf01495cef3ead909622682da6f", "ja": "一緒に遊ぼう！", "zh": "一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6100_p", "source_sha256": "803fd447d7d3b25da79430afb30d5e0db80933dd7186a7204a95aaf7b572b148", "ja": "まずお母さん猫を抱かせてもらおう。そしたら可憐から\nお母さんの匂いがして、子猫も安心するんじゃないか？", "zh": "先让我抱一下猫妈妈吧。这样一来，可怜身上就会有猫妈妈的气味，小猫也会更安心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6101_045kar", "source_sha256": "8ea62a571aef6478830efe7c866eec61ab52745132a4faa9c4d94cad91515396", "ja": "あっ、たしかに……。わ、私も子供の頃……\nお母さんの匂いで安心したことがあります……♪", "zh": "啊，确实……我、我小时候……\n也曾因为妈妈的气味而感到安心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6102_045kar", "source_sha256": "555757086b1b5ed643771ef7698074103b8e5717cb49bbf39121d4bb1c50d5c4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます。\n早速、お母さん猫のところに行ってきます。えへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您。\n我这就去猫妈妈那里看看。诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6200_p", "source_sha256": "a0c0b71fda5a0d6056c092b8f1ab7f9faf7b69b07e25d6db6dc0828e080c4ef9", "ja": "自分が子猫になったつもりで考えてみよう！\nどうされたら嬉しいか、何か分かるかもしれない。", "zh": "让我们设身处地，把自己当成小猫来想想吧！\n这样或许就能明白，怎样对待它会让它开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6201_045kar", "source_sha256": "c42d01f496b03f78565f7b8cc1133b1f868fb58d740eb75cf65b76a2fef5d8a7", "ja": "わ、私が子猫になるんですか……？　えーっと、私なら\n……{$P$}さんに……。そ、そっか。", "zh": "我、我要变成小猫吗……？　那个，要是我的话\n……对{$P$}先生……。这、这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6202_045kar", "source_sha256": "eec8a51de7cdbebed063034054ea815cb4357847844e4970ba99d1f8fd2a7d89", "ja": "分かったかもしれません……。子猫が安心すること。\nちょっと子猫のところに、い、行ってみますね……！", "zh": "我好像明白了……怎样才能让小猫安心。\n我、我去小猫那里看看吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6300_p", "source_sha256": "1fd2ddca9ed2e87b9ba099bcf8e0458c9f64a46cdfd30105d8a7c4c803c076e6", "ja": "お互い初対面なんだ。緊張するのは仕方ないよ。\n一緒に遊んで、仲良くなるきっかけを探そう！", "zh": "我们彼此都是第一次见面。会紧张也是没办法的事。\n一起玩玩，找个和对方熟悉起来的契机吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6301_045kar", "source_sha256": "dc0952bdd820bd104cf8284d301906667ae77006f85319ecab6040841c822439", "ja": "そ、そうですね。撮影まで時間がありますし……\nたくさん遊べば……仲良くなれます、よね……。", "zh": "是、是啊。离拍摄还有时间……\n多一起玩玩……就能变得要好了……对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_6302_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6e1ee5549e47fe2101a1d77f11075cea39e292f3e583b620eff9877fa260f23", "ja": "で、でも何をして遊べばいいんでしょう……それに、\nも、もし嫌われでもしたら……大丈夫でしょうか……？", "zh": "可、可是要玩些什么才好呢……而且，要、要是被讨厌了……真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
